#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genlib/glib2.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend='cairo'/> (for some GObject Introspection tests), <xref "
"linkend=\"dbus\"/> (for some tests), <xref linkend=\"fuse3\"/> and <ulink "
"url=\"https://bindfs.org/\">bindfs</ulink> (both needed for one test), <xref"
" linkend=\"gdb\"/> (for bindings), <xref linkend='gjs'/> (for some GObject "
